Scene summary: Hook: after services end, the newly appointed head of a rural puskesmas has just received a call from the sub-district head asking her to present the puskesmas performance at a cross-sector meeting; she has only led the puskesmas for a few months and wants to be seen as capable. The product does not appear. 9:16 vertical, realistic live-action, shot on a modern smartphone | Primary Video Type: UGC Native (Kapus baru beberapa bulan menjabat diminta camat memaparkan kinerja puskesmas di forum lintas sektor; ingin dinilai mampu) + Supporting Format: Product Demo | Handheld medium shots in an empty rural puskesmas waiting area in the late afternoon, then a small admin room; one close-up of her phone being lowered from her ear; Seq 3 single static tripod medium shot at the admin room desk. REFERENCE PRIORITY: Use DNA Character as the authority for the talent's FACE and BODY identity only (not the outfit). Use DNA Product as the authority for the exact product identity. WARDROBE below overrides any outfit visible in the DNA Character image. CHARACTER LOCK: Use the DNA Character reference ONLY for the talent's face and body identity: exact face shape, jawline, skin tone, eye shape, eyebrows, hair or hijab style, body proportions and distinguishing features. Do NOT copy the outfit from the reference image; the outfit is defined in WARDROBE below. Keep the exact same face and body throughout the sequence. Do not add accessories or name tags not listed in WARDROBE. WARDROBE (OVERRIDES REFERENCE OUTFIT): Light grey long-sleeve blouse with a simple collar, dark olive cardigan, black trousers, flat black shoes, round brown-framed glasses, small silver watch, hair half tied back. No name tag, no lanyard, no white coat. PRODUCT LOCK: Exact Paket Dokumen Inti Kepala Puskesmas ILP 2026 package box from the DNA Product reference image (the real package box mockup uploaded as an ingredient). Preserve the exact box colors, title text, emblem, cover photo, proportions and